Standing directives:
- At least one field-certified medical-nin is assigned to each four-man cell on B-rank and above where available (a core lesson of past shinobi wars).
- The director sets triage priority and oversees chakra-scalpel and Mystical Palm technique certification.

Roster maintained by the Medical Corps administration.
